      "id": "1343014595552813",
      "score": 3,
      "review_title": "Cool, But Stands Within The Crowd",
      "review_description": "The game is well optimized and enjoyable. However, it’s little to no different than the countless of inferior copies and remasters of, “Lethal Ape / Lethal Ape Redux.” Just as the name suggests, It is in fact “Facility Slop.” The overall formula and foundation of this game makes it really no different than what’s on the Meta Store today. I hope that the developers expand across the idea of the main premise of Lethal Ape and add more mechanics.",
      "date": 1788567218,
      "review_helpful_count": 2,
